.TH DANBY-LOADEDPENDULUM 1
.SH NAME
danby-loadedpendulum \- pendulum with constant applied torque
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/loadedpendulum
.SH MODEL
A constant load shifts static equilibrium according to torque balance. Beyond
the maximum gravitational restoring torque no locked equilibrium exists.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/loadedpendulum.b
